---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer - FinCalc Pro"
  description="Important disclaimer: FinCalc Pro's calculators provide estimates for informational purposes only and do not constitute financial, tax, or legal advice."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Disclaimer', url: '' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-prose mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-yellow-950 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 rounded p-4 mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-200">
        Important: This disclaimer applies to all content and calculators on FinCalc Pro. Please
        read it carefully.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Disclaimer</h1>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Not Financial Advice</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The calculators, tools, and content provided on FinCalc Pro are for <strong>informational and
      educational purposes only</strong>. They do not constitute financial advice, investment
      advice, or any other type of professional advice. The results generated by our calculators
      are estimates based on the information you provide and standard financial formulas. They
      should not be relied upon as the sole basis for making financial decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Not Tax Advice</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Tax calculations provided by our tools, including the Federal Income Tax Calculator and
      Paycheck Calculator, are estimates only. Tax laws, brackets, and deductions change frequently
      and vary based on individual circumstances. Consult a qualified tax professional or CPA for
      advice specific to your situation.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Not Legal Advice</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Nothing on this website should be interpreted as legal advice. If you require legal guidance
      regarding mortgages, contracts, estate planning, or any other matter, please consult a
      licensed attorney.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Accuracy of Calculations</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We strive to ensure that all calculator formulas are accurate and up to date. However,
      financial formulas can be complex, and errors may occur. We make no guarantees — express or
      implied — regarding the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any calculator results.
      <strong>We strongly recommend verifying all results independently</strong> with a qualified
      professional or through your financial institution before making any decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">No Professional Relationship</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Using FinCalc Pro's calculators does not create a professional advisor-client relationship
      between you and the operators of this website. No accountant, financial planner, tax
      specialist, or attorney is reviewing your inputs or results. The tools are automated and
      operate entirely client-side without human oversight.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Investment Risk</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Any investment-related calculators (Investment Growth, 401(k), IRA, etc.) use assumed rates
      of return that are hypothetical. Past performance does not guarantee future results. All
      investments carry risk, including the potential loss of principal. Our calculators do not
      account for market volatility, fees, taxes, or other factors that may significantly impact
      actual returns.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      We may link to third-party websites for reference or convenience. We are not responsible for
      the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any information, content, or services provided
      by third-party sites. Inclusion of a link does not imply endorsement.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Consult Qualified Professionals</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Before making any financial, tax, legal, or investment decision, you should consult with
      qualified professionals who understand your specific circumstances. This includes, but is
      not limited to:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1 text-muted-foreground">
      <li>A certified financial planner (CFP) for retirement and investment planning.</li>
      <li>A certified public accountant (CPA) or tax attorney for tax-related matters.</li>
      <li>A licensed real estate agent or mortgage broker for home buying decisions.</li>
      <li>A licensed attorney for legal matters.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="bg-muted border border-border rounded p-4 mt-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        By using FinCalc Pro, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this disclaimer and
        agree that the operators of this website shall not be held liable for any losses, damages,
        or consequences arising from the use of our calculators or content.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
